msgid "Copy this secret now. It will not be shown again."
msgstr "Nokopējiet šo slepeno atslēgu tagad. Tā vairs netiks parādīta."

msgctxt "webhooks"
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktīvs"

msgctxt "webhooks"
msgid ""
"Inactive webhooks receive no events and their queued deliveries are dropped"
msgstr ""
"Neaktīvi webhooki nesaņem nekādus notikumus, un to gaidošās piegādes tiek "
"atmestas"

